codex
A decisive issue has surfaced in the residual theorem: using the report’s own fibre equation, its contracted-component term enters the aggregate Euler identity with a minus sign, not a plus sign. I’m now checking whether Orevkov’s collapsed model eliminates that term altogether (which could rescue a corrected version), while separately testing the chart exponent dictionary.
