+preimage.  If `D` is smooth, (3.2) is
+`(N-a)(2-c)=N-1`; since `c>=1`, this forces `a=1,c=1`.
+In branch (ii), Orevkov 5.2 gives `nu>=s`.  With `c>=1`, (3.2) implies
+
