+
+## 4. Lemma 3.4 and Theorem 3.5
+
+**Lemma 3.4 — CONFIRMED (one omitted equality argument supplied).**  Let
+`S=Sing D`, `s=#S`, `nu=sum(r_p-1)`, and let the normalization be
