+## 7. Theorems 4.2–4.3 and Corollary 4.4
+
+**Theorem 4.2 — CONFIRMED for B0 and the numerical/monodromy conclusions;
+GAP for `(M)` at the stated proof scope.**  Proposition 4.1 kills the three
