+
+The displayed proof never establishes H3, whereas integration §1 promotes
+`(M')`, and therefore `(M)` after `b=0`, only under H2+H3.  With
+`chi~=chi_c(normalization(A_F))`, its promoted no-H3 form differs from `(M)`
