+```text
+2r_1+s_0c_0+sum_p(s_0k_p-t_p)-sum_p eps_p = 1+2s_0,
+```
+
+not the report's formula with `+sum eps_p`.  The claimed nonnegative-term
+argument and its `c_0,r_1` conclusions therefore do not follow.  Moreover,
