+```text
+s_0=s_1=1,  a_{D_0}=3,  a_{D_1}=2,
+normalization(D_0)=normalization(D_1)=A^1,
+2r_1+c_0+sum(k_p-t_p)=3,
+```
+
+and in fact `r_1=c_0=1` and `t_p=k_p`.  This source-based repair removes the
