+  Irreducibility is an explicit hypothesis and is essential in Lemma 3.4,
+  Theorem 3.5, Corollary 3.7, Theorem 4.2, and Corollary 5.1.  This is not an
+  illicit import, but it is consumption as a stated assumption.
